      "hadithIndex": 1798,
      "bookHadithIndex": 201,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Ata from Anbasah bin Abi Sufyan, that Umm Habibah said:\"I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) say: 'Whoever prays twelve rak'ahs a day, Allah (SWT), the Mighty and Sublime, will build for him a house in Paradise",
