      "bookIndex": 20,
      "hadithIndex": 1800,
      "bookHadithIndex": 203,
      "text": "It was narrated that Umm Habibah bint Abi Sufyan said:\"Whoever prays twelve rak'ahs in a day and prays before Zuhr, Allah (SWT) will build for him a house in Paradise",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-20-1800-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
